From 517a02e6368fd7706778472b9808f4833d754b4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SAI-THIHA-AUNG <yonekaung.kcn@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 06:02:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: first-run setup flow with profile-driven config and
 scoped sync

- Bootstrap admin only (no demo data); forced password change on first login
- Setup state derived from data: password -> connect ERPNext -> choose profiles
- ERPNext credentials verified with frappe.auth.get_logged_user (ping is guest-open); no .env fallback
- PosProfileConfig is the single mapper from ERPNext POS Profile to local config;
  applicable_for_users imported, profile visibility mirrors ERPNext semantics
- Removed hardcoded USD / $ / Standard Selling / Cash / My Company / fake Main POS
- Register and receipts use the profile/invoice currency
- Profile-scoped queued catalog sync (paged, delta by modified, sync_states),
  triggered on shift open, with a preparing screen
- Login throttling, unique-PIN enforcement, Users page
- Tests: SetupFlowTest, ProfileCatalogSyncTest

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AVPV8orZcwcbfwVpaxHkRq
